  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lando Norris was penalized five seconds for leaving the track and gaining a lasting advantage at Turn 12 in Austin, due to a breach of Article 33.3 of the FIA Formula One Sporting Regulations, as the driver had lost the 'right' to the corner and committed to an overtaking move on the outside.",
