      ],
      "supported": true,
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Max Verstappen was penalized ten seconds and received two penalty points for forcing another driver off the track at Turn 4 in Mexico, in violation of Appendix L, Chapter IV, Article 2 b) of the International Sporting Code, as Norris was ahead at the entry, apex, and exit of the turn.",
