            "label": "Infringement",
            "page": 1,
            "text": "Breach of Article 33.3 of the FIA Formula One Sporting Regulations.",
            "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/sites/default/files/decision-document/2024%20United%20States%20Grand%20Prix%20-%20Infringement%20-%20Car%204%20-%20Leaving%20the%20track%20and%20gaining%20an%20advantage.pdf#page=1"
