            "doc_id": "usa24-d69",
            "label": "Decision",
            "page": 1,
            "text": "5 second time penalty.",
            "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/sites/default/files/decision-document/2024%20United%20States%20Grand%20Prix%20-%20Infringement%20-%20Car%204%20-%20Leaving%20the%20track%20and%20gaining%20an%20advantage.pdf#page=1"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "usa24-d69:p1:reason-2",
            "doc_id": "usa24-d69",
            "label": "Reason, sentence 2",
            "page": 1,
            "text": "Car 4 was overtaking Car 1 on the outside, but was not level with Car 1 at the apex.",
            "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/sites/default/files/decision-document/2024%20United%20States%20Grand%20Prix%20-%20Infringement%20-%20Car%204%20-%20Leaving%20the%20track%20and%20gaining%20an%20advantage.pdf#page=1",
            "apex_spans": [
              [
                47,
                83
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "usa24-d69:p1:reason-3",
            "doc_id": "usa24-d69",
            "label": "Reason, sentence 3",
            "page": 1,
            "text": "Therefore under the Driving Standards Guidelines, Car 4 had lost the “right” to the corner.",
            "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/sites/default/files/decision-document/2024%20United%20States%20Grand%20Prix%20-%20Infringement%20-%20Car%204%20-%20Leaving%20the%20track%20and%20gaining%20an%20advantage.pdf#page=1"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "usa24-d69:p1:reason-4",
            "doc_id": "usa24-d69",
            "label": "Reason, sentence 4",
            "page": 1,
            "text": "Accordingly as Car 4 left the track and returned in front of Car 1, it is deemed to be a case of leaving the track and gaining a lasting advantage.",
            "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/sites/default/files/decision-document/2024%20United%20States%20Grand%20Prix%20-%20Infringement%20-%20Car%204%20-%20Leaving%20the%20track%20and%20gaining%20an%20advantage.pdf#page=1"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "usa24-d69:p1:reason-5",
            "doc_id": "usa24-d69",
            "label": "Reason, sentence 5",
            "page": 1,
            "text": "A 5 second penalty is imposed instead of the 10 second penalty recommended in the guidelines because having committed to the overtaking move on the outside the driver of Car 4 had little alternative other than to leave the track because of the proximity of Car 1 which had also left the track.",
            "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/sites/default/files/decision-document/2024%20United%20States%20Grand%20Prix%20-%20Infringement%20-%20Car%204%20-%20Leaving%20the%20track%20and%20gaining%20an%20advantage.pdf#page=1"
          },
          {
